  "reasoning": "The defendant Li facilitated the unlicensed production of pharmaceuticals by transporting equipment and raw materials to his mother, who manufactured drugs without a production license. This conduct constitutes the crime of illegal manufacturing and sale of counterfeit or unapproved drugs under Chinese criminal law. No other crimes described in the facts apply, and the appropriate statutory label is '非法生产、销售假药'.",
